WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.255
The External Partner Person is a person
whose employment or affiliation record,

2
00:00:05.255 --> 00:00:09.451
and primary credential, are held
by another organization: a state,

3
00:00:09.451 --> 00:00:12.326
a tribal government,
another federal agency,

4
00:00:12.326 --> 00:00:16.288
a financial institution, or an
academic or nonprofit partner.

5
00:00:16.288 --> 00:00:19.951
The class covers people; the
organization is the partner.

6
00:00:19.951 --> 00:00:23.052
The workbook's other
populations already have homes,

7
00:00:23.052 --> 00:00:26.437
so the chapter draws borders
rather than redefining them.

8
00:00:26.437 --> 00:00:30.680
Partner is not public: a member of
the public applying for a benefit

9
00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:34.613
isn't a workforce guest, even if
a partner delivers the benefit.

10
00:00:34.613 --> 00:00:39.564
Partner is not contractor: if the agency
holds the contract and the sponsor,

11
00:00:39.564 --> 00:00:44.037
and the person works on agency
business, that person is a contractor.

12
00:00:44.037 --> 00:00:46.666
Privilege and break-glass are overlays,

13
00:00:46.666 --> 00:00:50.488
and emergency access accounts
are always the agency's own.

14
00:00:50.488 --> 00:00:56.020
And an AI agent acting for a partner is a
non-person identity with its own sponsor.
